<h2 class="doc-h2">When the list is a catalogue</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Filtering in the browser is right for a list the server already sent. For ten thousand rows,
    put <code>up-autosubmit</code> and <code>up-target</code> on the input and let the server
    answer — <code>&lt;ComboboxList&gt;</code> is the fragment it swaps, and the markup is
    otherwise identical.
</p>

